@title Cooling selection: fan, filter fan or cooling unit from the heat result
@area Heat
# After a 3D heat run the Heat panel offers a Cooling selection section: what to add to hold the target inside, the balance behind it, and the planning-value caveat. The Cabinet Temperature panel has the same section.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text Simulate #2
wait 600
move 700 650
wait 10
click_text "Cooling selection"
wait 10
shot cooling-3d
check_blank cooling-3d
check_layout
